abel>&#x02020;</label><p>                     <italic>R</italic>                     <sub>merge</sub> = <inline-formula><inline-graphic xlink:href="d-64-01116-efi1.jpg" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="gif"/></inline-formula>                     <inline-formula><inline-graphic xlink:href="d-64-01116-efi2.jpg" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="gif"/></inline-formula>, where <italic>I</italic>                     <sub><italic>i</italic></sub>(<italic>hkl</italic>) is the intensity measured for the <italic>i</italic>th reflection and &#x02329;<italic>I</italic>(<italic>hkl</italic>)&#x0232a; is the average intensity of all reflections with indices <italic>hkl</italic>.</p></fn><fn id="tfn2"><label>&#x02021;</label><p>                     <italic>R</italic>                     <sub>working</sub> = <inline-formula><inline-graphic xlink:href="d-64-01116-efi3.jpg" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="gif"/></inline-formula>                     <inline-formula><inline-graphic xlink:href="d-64-01116-efi4.jpg" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="gif"/></inline-formula>; <italic>R</italic>                     <sub>free</sub> is calculated in an identical manner using 5% of randomly selected reflections that were not included in the refinement.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>